t":"实物股息登记截止","what_en":"Dividend in specie entitlement date","ann":"11674113","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11674113","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-10-28","type":"payment","what":"实物股息派发","what_en":"Dividend in specie crediting date","ann":"11674113","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11674113","src":"ai"},{"date":"2027-02-28","type":"results_due","what":"下一季 (12 月底结束) 季报最迟公布日 · 交易所规定","what_en":"Deadline for the quarter ending Dec (Bursa rule)","src":"rule"}],"recent_en":"Mi Technovation announced in late October the acquisition of a 7-storey industrial building in Singapore for SGD103.88 million (about RM331.8 million) to house its global hub. The company continued share buybacks and completed a dividend-in-specie distribution of Mi Material Holding shares on a 1-for-100 basis. Latest quarterly revenue rose 29.9% year-on-year and net profit grew 84.8% year-on-year.","notable_en":["Proposed acquisition of a 7-storey industrial building at 25 New Industrial Road, Singapore for SGD103.88 million (about RM331.8 million) as a global hub.","Dividend-in-specie distribution of up to 9 million Mi Material Holding shares on a 1-for-100 basis.","Latest quarterly revenue of RM256.0 million and net profit of RM66.8 million, up 29.9% and 84.8% year-on-year respectively."],"risks_en":["The company has been conducting ongoing share buybacks.","There were multiple changes in director and substantial shareholder interests between September and November, including CEO Oh Kuang Eng acquiring shares in the open market."],"earnings_en":"3Q2026 revenue was RM256.0 million, up 13.3% QoQ and 29.9% YoY; net profit was RM66.8 million, up 21.1% QoQ and 84.8% YoY; net margin was 26.1%, higher than 24.4% in the previous quarter."}